{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【C108】《嘟嘟臉惡作劇》攤位報導！斯皮奇在Comic Market大量出沒 混亂場面讓路人紛紛停下腳步</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0ba0dcab2b9640241bf404ad5099d3d47b14c6671ac082df78102b30d61d109b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F02cbb570def9ec02436f21ac254e95ce.jpg\"/><p>2026年8月15日（六）、16日（日）正在日本舉辦的同人誌即賣會「 Comic Market 108 」。 這次要為大家帶來《 嘟嘟臉惡作劇 》攤位的現場報導！</p><h3>斯皮奇在Comic Market大量出沒中！《嘟嘟臉惡作劇》攤位報導！</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e53506a3fa66de3a57878cbae9592c963ccc6b1ba4bd71d4dfd6886e3b8a88c8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc7f3b672c8a451b56ab4bde6458e92c4.jpg\"/><p>在東京 Big Sight 西3展廳1151號攤位展出的 《嘟嘟臉惡作劇》( @trickcal_jp )攤位。</p><p>主哇喲主哇喲</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fc1956a85b3ade43c250a46c01d9f9c87688d244c3e92edcc2a423a35c064dbf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feb09cbbb7fa102078b1bb41ec3776b17.jpg\"/><p>與其說是太過斯皮奇……不如說是徹底將 斯皮奇 元素發揮到極致的攤位。</p><p>喜歡打掃的斯皮奇們。</p><p>二創作品藝廊＆人氣投票企劃</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0dd666f08ba9b6cadb05070cf466f9f113446ca1904185209806fd387df65c7d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fade7d7b217594c56428f3cbd21766b43.jpg\"/><p>攤位現場也正在舉辦二創作品藝廊＆人氣投票企劃。</p><p>每人可投2票</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/973e924431a458b068c8f819422617b33ed6f96fca95b09147fdfb56eb3c1cd9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1996509f23b38a66e7065f0bad4eed7d.jpg\"/><p>包括 SUWA DYNAMICS【illustration】( @x_SD_artech_x )以及ずんだおばけ( @ZundaGhost )等眾多作品都獲得了投票。</p><p>是斯皮奇！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/895b36d1eaf9d1c436330dacc71716cde4a7b0828e14e2489a5d85d4065f3a47/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F853405b55e2c1d1cbaed1024be827c55.jpg\"/><p>如果運氣好的話，說不定還能遇到會動的斯皮奇！？</p><h3>Cosplayer 也登場！</h3><p>錫安 / Camomile</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/57e44112001cc13487e897426aab55963af49f529541b93a304785f63768bebd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8f971c75cfc583ded6930be383d056e6.jpg\"/><p>X: @chamomile_chami</p><p>Instagram: @chamomile_chami</p><p>奶油 / 貓田 Ashu</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/44fa087f13981c34a0f065822eea59b3d53877f7e227752d6d742fcbea18c753/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6d252aab79f25196781aa4b9a73a279a.jpg\"/><p>X: @Nekota_Ashu</p><p>Instagram: @nekota_ashu</p><p>柯米 / Sosuke Ichinohe</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d910dc761dda0d3a9ee17219b6292cbac63230426b63dc9e4565cf33bb92e8a8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6984355e7b0e9713f8e10f9c661542e8.jpg\"/><p>X: @s_ichinohe321</p><p>Instagram: @s.ichinohe321</p><p>🔸【C108】藍色星原：旅謠、Yostar 攤位報導！打造會場內最大規模之一的周邊販售區 🔸【C108】Milk Factory展位的Cosplay照片報導！FLEIA、KETOLU、馨くん等人登場 🔸【C108】TERBIS展位Cosplay照片報導！韓國演出陣營也相當出色 🔸【C108】《棕色塵埃2》攤位報導！一如既往的高品質 Cosplay 讓粉絲熱血沸騰 🔸【C108】《勝利女神：妮姬》攤位報導！夏日祭典風格佈置登場 Cosplay 攝影會盛況空前</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T08:37:53.341536+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":866,"images":9,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}